[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-dangote-graduate-trainee-2026-program-career-opportunity-for-young-nigerians-218":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},218,"dangote-graduate-trainee-2026-program-career-opportunity-for-young-nigerians-218","Dangote Graduate Trainee 2026 Program: Career Opportunity For Young Nigerians","\u003Cp>The 2025 Graduate Trainee Technical Engineers Knowledge Transfer Programme at Dangote Cement not only provides exposure to the inner workings of the company, but also acts as a launchpad for young professionals to thrive in their careers.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>As a graduate trainee at Dangote, you will embark on a practical development journey that combines technical on-the-job training with exposure to various departments within the organization.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Dangote Refinery Graduate Trainee Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: Dangote Plc\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Finternships\">Internships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Employment\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Networking\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Career Development\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: Not Specified\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Dangote Graduate Trainee Program Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Are you a high-potential, vibrant, and enthusiastic initiative-taker looking to kick-start your career in a leading oil and gas company in Africa? Look no further than Dangote Petroleum Refinery &amp; Petrochemicals!\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>At Dangote Petroleum Refinery and Petrochemicals, we are offering you the opportunity to join our 2026 Graduate Programme, where you will have a chance to learn and grow in a global business environment while supporting the growth of our organisation.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Throughout the 18-month programme, you will be exposed to various functions of refinery operations, gaining hands-on experience and learning from our highly skilled professionals. Be prepared to develop your skills, expand your knowledge, and make a true impact in the oil and gas industry.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Dangote Graduate Trainee 2026 Nigeria Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To qualify for the Dangote Graduate Trainee 2026 Nigeria, aspiring individuals need to meet specific criteria. The requirements include\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Technical: First Degree\u002FHigher Diploma in Chemical, Production, Mining Engineering; Geological Sciences, Laboratory Sciences, Bio-Chemistry.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Technical Support: First Degree\u002FHigher Diploma in Mechanical, Electrical, Instrumentation, and Power Engineering disciplines.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Support: A Degree or Diploma in Accounting &amp; Finance, Social Sciences, Humanities, Business Administration, Law, or Information Technology.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Minimum of Second-Class Lower\u002FHND Upper Credit.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Must not be above 28 years by May 31, 2026.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>How Much is Dangote Graduate Trainee Salary?\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Dangote Graduate Trainee Salary ranges between ₦250,000 and ₦350,000 monthly.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Dangote Graduate Trainee 2026 Nigeria Program\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Dangote Graduate Trainee Program,  \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Interested and qualified individuals can apply for the Dangote Group Graduate Trainee Program through the provided application link below.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applicants are to fill out a form, upload the required documents, and submit as soon as possible.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click the green button below to begin your application.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fforms.cloud.microsoft\u002Fpages\u002Fresponsepage.aspx?id=HEXDlrgNGU-Ir1ywbApD_l0crNpGdXNAnAtVn8YTgbdURDFHQ0FNVlRDMTNVMjkwRFNBRjlWSVREWS4u&amp;origin=QRCode&amp;route=shorturl\">https:\u002F\u002Fforms.cloud.microsoft\u002Fpages\u002Fresponsepage.aspx?id=HEXDlrgNGU-Ir1ywbApD_l0crNpGdXNAnAtVn8YTgbdURDFHQ0FNVlRDMTNVMjkwRFNBRjlWSVREWS4u&amp;origin=QRCode&amp;route=shorturl\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","LINKSKOOL",16,"published",0,"2026-05-07 17:22:52",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdangote-graduate-trainee-2026-program-career-opportunity-for-young-nigerians\u002F69fcbc5cc66a84.85327559_screenshot 2026-05-07 171834.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdangote-graduate-trainee-2026-program-career-opportunity-for-young-nigerians\u002F69fcbc5cc66a84.85327559_screenshot%202026-05-07%20171834.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,37,47,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":9},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-fun